import{_ as o,o as i,c as n,a2 as a}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const h=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 147 | Realm Refinement · Boundary-Breaking Realm · Planetary and Cosmic Beings Promotion Logic","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 147 | Realm Refinement · Boundary-Breaking Realm · Planetary and Cosmic Beings Promotion Logic","no":147,"module":1,"tags":["Realm","Boundary-Breaking Realm","Planetary Consciousness","Cosmic Beings","Promotion Logic"],"related":["14-Unified Cultivation Realm Classification","53-Exotic Life Recognition Standard","07-Self-Generated Self-Grown Evolution Law"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0147_模块1-破界境-星球级宇宙生灵晋升.md","filePath":"en/0147_模块1-破界境-星球级宇宙生灵晋升.md"}'),t={name:"en/0147_模块1-破界境-星球级宇宙生灵晋升.md"};function s(r,e,l,c,u,d){return i(),n("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[a('<h1 id="entry-147-boundary-breaking-realm-promotion-logic-for-planetary-life-and-cosmic-beings" tabindex="-1">Entry 147 | Boundary-Breaking Realm: Promotion Logic for Planetary Life and Cosmic Beings <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-147-boundary-breaking-realm-promotion-logic-for-planetary-life-and-cosmic-beings" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 147 | Boundary-Breaking Realm: Promotion Logic for Planetary Life and Cosmic Beings&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 1 · In-Depth Realm Refinement | Baseline references: Documents 14, 53, 07</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-when-a-planet-begins-to-cultivate" tabindex="-1">Introduction: When a planet begins to cultivate <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-when-a-planet-begins-to-cultivate" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: When a planet begins to cultivate&quot;">​</a></h2><p>One of Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s most unique promises is pushing the definition of &quot;life&quot; to the extreme — a conscious planet, a cosmic origin body, under the republican axiom of Myriad Races equally possess evolutionary qualification. Per the Unified Cultivation Realm Classification (Document 14), the Boundary-Breaking Realm requires &quot;breaking through plane-law limits, anchor-free cross-plane travel.&quot; For a human cultivator this is learning a technique; for <strong>planetary consciousness and cosmic beings</strong>, this equals requiring &quot;the entire planet/entire cosmic region learn to leave its shell and walk next door.&quot; This entry explains the promotion logic of such giant life in the Boundary-Breaking Realm.</p><p>The six top-level axioms running through the text are pushed to extreme scale here: the republican axiom of Myriad Races requires planetary consciousness to be not &quot;dead matter&quot; but a qualified cultivation subject; the anti-predation axiom forbids cosmic beings from making swallowing neighboring planes their evolutionary path; the collective ascension axiom requires planetary consciousness to give back to the beings upon it after promotion; causal self-discipline and law-first constrain such giant operations from tearing cosmic structure. Per the Exotic Life Recognition Standard (Document 53) and Self-Generated Self-Grown Evolution Law (Document 07), such life walks a promotion road completely different from individual cultivators. Among them, Article 6 the universal equal infinite law establishes the origin logic that all beings inherently possess basic infinite power, and predation loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-who-are-planetary-level-cosmic-beings" tabindex="-1">I. Who Are &quot;Planetary-Level Cosmic Beings&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-who-are-planetary-level-cosmic-beings" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Who Are &quot;Planetary-Level Cosmic Beings&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>First define the scope. This entry refers to two categories:</p><ul><li><strong>Planetary consciousness</strong>: an overall consciousness body naturally gestated by a material planet after eons of energy immersion and collective karma of all beings (similar to planetary-level sentience)</li><li><strong>Cosmic beings/cosmic origin bodies</strong>: larger-scale life forms whose body itself is a small cosmic region or origin condensate</li></ul><p>They mostly belong to &quot;exotic life&quot; or cross-genealogy giant life in Document 53; when recognized, they are assessed on seven dimensions (life form, energy features, consciousness level, etc.) and included in the cultivation system by the &quot;non-discrimination, symbiosis-first&quot; principle, not cleared as disasters.</p><h2 id="ii-promotion-logic-from-self-rotation-to-cross-boundary" tabindex="-1">II. Promotion Logic: From &quot;Self-Rotation&quot; to &quot;Cross-Boundary&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-promotion-logic-from-self-rotation-to-cross-boundary" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Promotion Logic: From &quot;Self-Rotation&quot; to &quot;Cross-Boundary&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Planetary-level beings&#39; boundary-breaking is completely different from individual cultivators in time scale and operation object:</p><ol><li><strong>Consciousness awakening stage</strong>: planetary consciousness awakens from eons of chaos, first completing its own long &quot;Sense–Dao Integration&quot; journey (counted in geological time)</li><li><strong>Intra-plane stabilization</strong>: consciousness deeply couples with the planet/cosmic region, internal laws self-consistent, no longer oscillating from all beings&#39; collective karma</li><li><strong>Overall plane-membrane perception</strong>: giant life does not &quot;body through the membrane,&quot; but extends consciousness outside its own boundary, perceiving &quot;the outer wall of my cosmic region&quot;</li><li><strong>Overall boundary-breaking</strong>: not moving the planet, but <strong>letting its own law domain be recognized and accommodated by neighboring planes&#39; laws</strong>, achieving &quot;consciousness reachable, laws connectable&quot;</li></ol><p>For planetary consciousness, the ultimate form of &quot;anchor-free travel&quot; is not physical movement, but <strong>establishing cross-plane consciousness and law channels</strong> — it need not leave home, yet can connect home to home.</p><h2 id="iii-unique-pain-points-and-costs" tabindex="-1">III. Unique Pain Points and Costs <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-unique-pain-points-and-costs" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Unique Pain Points and Costs&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Giant life&#39;s boundary-breaking costs are staggering in scale:</p><ul><li><strong>All beings synchronization risk</strong>: once planetary consciousness oscillates across boundaries, every cultivator&#39;s field upon it is affected — the collective ascension axiom requires it to first protect all beings before talking about its own promotion</li><li><strong>Law rejection amplified</strong>: if a planet&#39;s laws are incompatible with a neighboring plane, cross-boundary attempts may cause two-plane law conflict, consequences far greater than individual rejection</li><li><strong>Time-scale mismatch</strong>: planetary consciousness thinks in ten-thousand-year units, individual cultivators in hundred-year units; their coordination requires special Alaya time bridging</li><li><strong>Solitary evolution</strong>: awakening alone for eons, prone to &quot;I am the cosmos&quot; arrogance, sliding into the predatory faction&#39;s cosmic behemoth psychological soil</li></ul><p>The Alaya Network and multi-layer supervision impose <strong>cosmic-level filing</strong> on such giant operations: before cross-boundary attempts, the Anchor Council must assess the impact on all beings, confirming &quot;only increments, no stock consumption, no causal disturbance&quot; before passage.</p><h2 id="iv-coordination-with-individual-cultivators" tabindex="-1">IV. Coordination with Individual Cultivators <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-coordination-with-individual-cultivators" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Coordination with Individual Cultivators&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Planetary-level beings&#39; boundary-breaking is never solitary:</p><ul><li>It needs individual boundary-breakers (see Entries 143, 144) as &quot;advance probes,&quot; first exploring neighboring plane laws</li><li>Its cross-boundary channels in turn become safe lanes for individual cultivators, achieving two-way empowerment of giant and individual</li><li>Planetary consciousness after promotion undertakes the &quot;plane guardian&quot; public position, coordinating with Plane Transcendents (Origin Realm) to maintain cosmic stability</li></ul><p>This nested symbiosis of &quot;giant life — individual cultivator&quot; is precisely the three-dimensional version of the collective ascension axiom: the strong uplift all beings, and all beings also uphold the strong.</p><h2 id="v-breakthrough-features-from-dormant-planet-to-cross-boundary-cosmic-being" tabindex="-1">V. Breakthrough Features: From &quot;Dormant Planet&quot; to &quot;Cross-Boundary Cosmic Being&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-breakthrough-features-from-dormant-planet-to-cross-boundary-cosmic-being" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Breakthrough Features: From &quot;Dormant Planet&quot; to &quot;Cross-Boundary Cosmic Being&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Markers for planetary-level beings who successfully break the boundary:</p><ul><li>Consciousness extension stably covers outside its own boundary, perceiving neighboring planes</li><li>Own law domain achieves law compatibility and intercommunication with at least one neighboring plane</li><li>The cross-boundary process causes no causal disturbance to the beings upon it</li><li>Actively undertakes cross-plane guardian responsibility, accepting Anchor Council supervision</li></ul><h2 id="vi-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">VI. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Universal infinite backstop</strong>: the universal equal infinite law establishes that every being inherently possesses basic infinite power; the easygoing have a guarantee, strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose, predation naturally loses meaning</li><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: activating a dormant eon-spanning planetary consciousness — this huge evolutionary asset — into a cross-boundary guardian, rather than letting it idle</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: cosmic being promotion relies not on swallowing neighboring planes, but on law compatibility and channel co-building</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper limit comparison</strong>: old-system planetary consciousness/cosmic behemoths were often subdued or slain by the protagonist as mounts; Heng Yuan Zhou recognizes their equal cultivation-subject status</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: planetary consciousness and cosmic origin bodies are explicitly included in Myriad Races&#39; 99% coverage; &quot;path for all&quot; extends to &quot;path for all stars&quot;</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: planetary-level beings&#39; cross-boundary experience is relayed back to the whole network, paving the way for the Multiverse Realm&#39;s (from Entry 164) cross-cosmos governance</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>When a conscious planet learns to &quot;drop by,&quot; cosmic scale is no longer distance but network. Planetary-level beings&#39; boundary-breaking proves: evolutionary qualification belongs neither to the tiny individual nor to the massive behemoth, but to all life willing to symbiose with Myriad Races — no matter how large.</p><p>In the final analysis, the Boundary-Breaking Realm planetary and cosmic being promotion described in this document is no isolated case — always pointing toward the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization&#39;s co-building direction; law self-consistency is backstopped by the law-first axiom, not drifting with narrative convenience.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./14-修炼境界统一划分.html">14-Unified Cultivation Realm Classification</a> · <a href="./53-奇特生命识别标准.html">53-Exotic Life Recognition Standard</a> · <a href="./07-自生自长进化法则.html">07-Self-Generated Self-Grown Evolution Law</a> · <a href="./54-奇特生命三类处置流程.html">54-Exotic Life Three-Type Disposal Process</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',31)])])}const m=o(t,[["render",s]]);export{h as __pageData,m as default};
